VM cross-mode time.Point value marshaling drops the int64 seconds field across the VM<->native injection boundary (FromUnix/Sub/ToUnix/SecondsSinceEpoch on a {i64,i32} struct), so a computed second count reads 0. Correct on all compiled backends. Same root cause as the os.Stat ModTime sec<=0 VM bug; see claude-todo.md (VM time.Point int64 marshaling).
